complete","source_id":"s-chenshu-023-wangyu-complete-ws1514496"},{"id":"c-chenshu-023-wangyu-complete:received_sentence1-131","kind":"received_sentence","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAAABAAB","source_quote":"天嘉二年還朝，詔復侍中，頃之卒，時年四十。","reading":"天嘉二年返朝、復侍中，頃之卒，報齡四十。二年繫還朝；袁憲本傳稱天嘉初。","note":"天嘉二年返朝、復侍中，頃之卒，報齡四十。二年繫還朝；袁憲本傳稱天嘉初。","paragraph_id":"c-chenshu-023-wangyu-complete:p001","start_codepoint":131,"end_codepoint":152,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-chenshu-023-wangyu-complete","source_id":"s-chenshu-023-wangyu-complete-ws1514496"},{"id":"c-chenshu-023-wangyu-complete:received_sentence1-152","kind":"received_sentence","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAAABAAB","source_quote":"贈本官，諡曰貞子。","reading":"身後贈本官、諡貞子。","note":"身後贈本官、諡貞子。","paragraph_id":"c-chenshu-023-wangyu-complete:p001","start_codepoint":152,"end_codepoint":161,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-chenshu-023-wangyu-complete","source_id":"s-chenshu-023-wangyu-complete-ws1514496"}],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-chen023-yu-brother","subject_person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAAABAAB","object_person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAAABAAA","predicate":"brother","qualifiers":{"source_term":"瑒第十三弟瑜"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-chenshu","book_id":"b-chenshu-023","chapter_id":"c-chenshu-023-wangyu-complete","source_id":"s-chenshu-023-wangyu-complete-ws1514496","paragraph_id":"c-chenshu-023-wangyu-complete:p001","quote":"瑒第十三弟瑜，字子珪，亦知名，美容儀，早歷清顯，年（五）〔三〕十，官至侍中。永定元年，使於齊，以陳郡袁憲為副，齊以王琳之故，執而囚之。齊文宣帝每行，載死囚以從，齊人呼曰「供御囚」，每有他怒，則召殺之，以快其意。瑜及憲並危殆者數矣，齊僕射楊遵彥憫其無辜，每救護之。天嘉二年還朝，詔復侍中，頃之卒，時年四十。贈本官，諡曰貞子。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-chenshu-023-wangyu-complete:p001:m0005","object_person_mention_id":"c-chenshu-023-wangyu-complete:p001:m0000"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"傳以瑒為兄。第十三弟依原句保存。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false},{"id":"a-nanshi021-wangyu-129-0","subject_person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAAABAAB","object_person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAAABAAA","predi